        "notes": "Bad Mineral contains somewhat cartoonic violence and gore, with large drops of blood that fall from characters, exposed zombie guts, decapitation and flying skull and brain fragments.\r\n\r\nThe game also has a theme of hard drug use, where players take an unspecified substance for the purpose of combat. Drug use is not shown, but they have bloody noses, and there is a snorting sound, followed by characters saying something like \"Oh, yeah.\"\r\n\r\nGibs, blood and decapitation can be turned off in settings."
